Hand-made fixtures (2026-11-17) for WorldMapGateway: sample = a small, real-shaped (real continent keys / real zone names, areas, rects — polygons simplified to rectangles) excerpt of priv/world_map/world_map_vectors.json, trimmed for fast tests; malformed_json = truncated JSON; missing_zones = valid JSON with no "zones" key, exercising the fail-loudly path. Not captured from any external source.
